SELECT gen_random_uuid()::text, 'Cybersecurity in Action: CyberSecurity Essentials COIL project', 'A pilot international COIL project built on the CyberSecurity Essentials module created by Anton Dmytrenko. Master’s students from the KNU Faculty of Information Technology worked with peers from Colombia and Chile through interactive workshops and a final poster session.

