SELECT gen_random_uuid()::text, 'Cyber Risks and Business Intelligence', 'The second VIRaTeC COIL module, run by Taras Shevchenko National University of Kyiv together with the American University in the Emirates. Across five sessions, student leads Anastasiia Loban and Anton Dmytrenko worked with academic and business experts on cyber risks and business intelligence.

